{"4781390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "英雄冒险团", "steam_appid": 4781390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>PC Special Edition</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PC Exclusive Edition — Claim free-time-limited perks now and gain an early-game advantage!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/03a13d977b9b53872f9d4db290e8ebc0.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/03a13d977b9b53872f9d4db290e8ebc0.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/03a13d977b9b53872f9d4db290e8ebc0.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/5bde696b75163acc553807964262b6f9.avif?t=1786603178\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras_big/5bde696b75163acc553807964262b6f9.avif?t=1786603178 width=1560 height=712 /></span><strong>Team up for epic adventures, farm powerful gear, strike it rich with rare loot, and conquer massive raid bosses! A fantasy MMORPG that keeps you coming back for more with every adventure.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/b186dbf0ba491fd82f56ef3ae3acb4fc.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience the True Spirit of Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Hero Adventure Group, you'll journey across a fantasy world filled with danger, mystery, and opportunity. Begin as a humble adventurer and forge your path toward becoming a legendary hero capable of conquering epic raid encounters.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast and immersive regions on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters and collect powerful gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge demanding solo and 5-player dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with friends and build your guild</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble raid teams to take down colossal bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique class builds and skill rotations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/62ac80e25e70e14217878137ef6df17e.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/62ac80e25e70e14217878137ef6df17e.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/62ac80e25e70e14217878137ef6df17e.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/e3987d48772f52e027eadaea54a50bdd.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Seven Races. Unlimited Beginnings!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚩 <strong>Alliance</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human</strong> — Warrior, Mage, Priest, Rogue, Paladin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Elf</strong> — Warrior, Priest, Rogue, Hunter, Demon Hunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dwarf</strong> — Warrior, Priest, Rogue, Hunter, Paladin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gnome</strong> — <i>Coming Soon</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔱 <strong>Horde</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orc</strong> — Warrior, Rogue, Hunter, Shaman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undead</strong> — Warrior, Rogue, Mage, Priest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tauren</strong> — Warrior, Hunter, Shaman</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Eight Unique Classes. Endless Ways to Play!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Warrior — Charge Into the Front Lines!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High survivability and powerful melee combat make the Warrior a reliable force in both leveling and dungeon progression. If you enjoy standing toe-to-toe with mighty bosses, the Warrior is the perfect choice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Mage — Master of Devastating Magic!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of Fire and Frost to unleash explosive damage and dominate the battlefield. Clear waves of enemies with powerful area attacks and enjoy the thrill of overwhelming magical destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Priest — The Heart of Every Team!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Holy healing and Shadow damage to fit your preferred playstyle. Whether adventuring solo, conquering dungeons, or supporting your guild, Priests are invaluable in every situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗡️ Rogue — Deadly Precision and Unmatched Mobility!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of stealth and assassination, the Rogue excels at delivering devastating burst damage while staying highly mobile. Strike from the shadows and become a deadly threat in both boss encounters and PvP battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏹 Hunter — Precision at Range, Strength in Partnership!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside a loyal companion while eliminating enemies from a safe distance. With reliable ranged damage and excellent versatility, Hunters excel in both solo adventures and group content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Shaman — Wielder of the Elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the forces of lightning, fire, and earth to crush your enemies. With powerful support abilities and healing magic, Shamans are a cornerstone of any Horde warband and a valuable ally in every battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌙 Demon Hunter — Become the Blade of Vengeance!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash incredible mobility and explosive damage as you weave through the battlefield. Harness chaotic demonic powers to tear through enemies and overcome any obstacle in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡️ Paladin — Champion of the Light!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A versatile class capable of tanking, healing, and dealing damage. Protect your allies with unwavering faith or wield the power of the Light to smite your foes on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/c489ddaad82979cd464479cfbd3b7da5.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Own Playstyle</strong>,<strong>No fixed meta. No forced paths. Your mastery defines your adventure!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely mix and match universal skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two specialization talent builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique combat style and character build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/92c398c9850d6d8ec8221030865276bf.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gear Hunting Is What Makes RPGs Truly Fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Gear</strong> — Ideal for open-world exploration and everyday progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Gear</strong> — Exclusive drops from high-difficulty dungeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonuses from both gear sets can be active simultaneously, giving your character more strategic progression options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/09ad84350af760592df2b9c416741e80.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>As You Grow Stronger, the Real Adventure Begins!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-Player High-Difficulty Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large-Scale Epic Battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordination, positioning, skill rotations, and class roles—only a true team can conquer the mightiest bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/9805a514ccacb2931295abfd628b5e4a.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.