with powerful area attacks and enjoy the thrill of overwhelming magical destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Priest — The Heart of Every Team!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Holy healing and Shadow damage to fit your preferred playstyle. Whether adventuring solo, conquering dungeons, or supporting your guild, Priests are invaluable in every situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗡️ Rogue — Deadly Precision and Unmatched Mobility!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A master of stealth and assassination, the Rogue excels at delivering devastating burst damage while staying highly mobile. Strike from the shadows and become a deadly threat in both boss encounters and PvP battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏹 Hunter — Precision at Range, Strength in Partnership!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside a loyal companion while eliminating enemies from a safe distance. With reliable ranged damage and excellent versatility, Hunters excel in both solo adventures and group content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Shaman — Wielder of the Elements!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the forces of lightning, fire, and earth to crush your enemies. With powerful support abilities and healing magic, Shamans are a cornerstone of any Horde warband and a valuable ally in every battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌙 Demon Hunter — Become the Blade of Vengeance!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash incredible mobility and explosive damage as you weave through the battlefield. Harness chaotic demonic powers to tear through enemies and overcome any obstacle in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛡️ Paladin — Champion of the Light!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A versatile class capable of tanking, healing, and dealing damage. Protect your allies with unwavering faith or wield the power of the Light to smite your foes on the front lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/90ef8cdf4be1fb8033ed7bae87ee7619.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/c489ddaad82979cd464479cfbd3b7da5.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build Your Own Playstyle</strong>,<strong>No fixed meta. No forced paths. Your mastery defines your adventure!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely mix and match universal skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two specialization talent builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique combat style and character build</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/6b03cafce098e32c5169dfe43e5709e1.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/92c398c9850d6d8ec8221030865276bf.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gear Hunting Is What Makes RPGs Truly Fun!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Gear</strong> — Ideal for open-world exploration and everyday progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Gear</strong> — Exclusive drops from high-difficulty dungeons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bonuses from both gear sets can be active simultaneously, giving your character more strategic progression options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/349e3094c82f75b486d2babf5794f37e.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/09ad84350af760592df2b9c416741e80.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>As You Grow Stronger, the Real Adventure Begins!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5-Player High-Difficulty Dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large-Scale Epic Battles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coordination, positioning, skill rotations, and class roles—only a true team can conquer the mightiest bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/9805a514ccacb2931295abfd628b5e4a.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/9805a514ccacb2931295abfd628b5e4a.webm?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/9805a514ccacb2931295abfd628b5e4a.mp4?t=1786603178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/a194d7277060edec13d08ccc621c9d64.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1200 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Start with Nothing but Common Gear, Gather Your Allies, and Rise to Challenge Epic Bosses—Your Adventure Begins Now!</strong><br><strong>Your next legendary piece of equipment might be waiting on the very next boss you defeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/ae314e6d4d3b1149f271f6bc415a88f1.poster.avif?t=1786603178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4781390/extras/ae314e6d4d3b1149f27